# Image optimization

When adding or changing images in this repo, follow the project skill:

Read and apply `.cursor/skills/optimize-images/SKILL.md`.

Mandatory:
1. Run `npm run optimize:images` after dropping jpg/jpeg/png under `public/`.
2. Register assets in `src/data/images.ts` with `.webp` paths.
3. Render with `PlaceholderImage` (not bare `<img>` for content photos).
